Note: All other edge functions also have `"Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*"`. This is standard for Supabase Edge Functions called via `supabase.functions.invoke()` since the Supabase client adds the Authorization header. However, `send-email` should at minimum verify the caller is authenticated (it already does via auth header check). The CORS header is less critical given the auth requirement but should still be tightened for defense in depth.

