The `ranking` state flag is already set at the beginning of `handleRankNew` (line 319) and `handleRankExisting` (line 372). However, `handleRankClick` (line 306) calls `validate()` before calling those methods, creating a gap where a second click can get through before `setRanking(true)` takes effect.

